From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 20:35:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf: optimize CheckRegularTransaction, single-write
 BlockUndo, and bulk mempool clear

Apply hot-path validation, serialization, and mempool micro-optimizations:
- Fast O(N^2) duplicate-input check in CheckRegularTransaction for tx.vin.size() <= 8 without unordered_set heap allocation
- Cache serialized transaction byte size (m_serialize_size) during CTransaction::ComputeHash via CountingHashWriter
- Buffer WriteBlock and WriteBlockUndo into a single DataStream write and hash pass
- Skip redundant AccessCoin height lookup in ConnectBlock when SEQUENCE_LOCKTIME_DISABLE_FLAG is set
- Add TryClearAllForConnectedBlock fast path when a connected block drains the entire mempool
- Add ValidationSignals::TransactionsAddedToMempoolBatch for coalesced batch mempool notifications
